# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`deny`** (precedence 1): structurally destructive shapes are blocked outright, even when sandboxed. Covers shell loops (`for`/`while`/`until`), cross-repo `git -C *`, force-push/reset/clean/amend, `rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, privileged `gh` verbs (`secret`/`ssh-key`/`gpg-key`/`variable`/`extension`/`workflow enable`/`workflow disable`/`repo delete`/`pr merge`/`issue transfer`), and mutating `gh api` verbs (`DELETE`/`PUT`, secrets/keys/collaborators/merge paths)."
msgstr "**`deny`** (Предимство 1): Структурно разрушителни форми са блокирани напълно, дори когато пясъчници. Облицовки на обвивката (`for`/`while`/`until`), cross-repo `git -C *`, force-push/reset/clean/amend, `rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, привилегировани `gh` глаголи (`secret`/`ssh-key`/`gpg-key`/`variable`/`extension`/`workflow enable`/`workflow disable`/`repo delete`/`pr merge`/`issue transfer`), и мутира `gh api` глаголи (`DELETE`/`PUT`, secrets/keys/collaborators/merge пътища)."

