# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Any credential an addon needs is declared in `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` and read via `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')`. There is no new secret store."
msgstr "Всяко признание, което е необходимо на addon се декларира в `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` и четете чрез `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')`. Няма нов таен магазин."

