# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "MDAD's `ansible-playbook setup.yml` invocation is encapsulated in a dedicated sub-container (DinD #2 relative to the Infinito deploy container which is DinD #1). The runner image is built locally from `roles/web-app-matrix/files/flavor/ansible/runner/Dockerfile` and pinned via `services.matrix.runner.image`. The runner bind-mounts `/var/run/docker.sock`, `/etc/systemd/system`, `/run/systemd`, `/usr/local/bin`, `/matrix`, and the MDAD checkout so MDAD's writes land in the deploy container's namespace (same Docker daemon and systemd as the rest of the stack)."
msgstr "MDAD's `ansible-playbook setup.yml` икона е капсулована в специален подраздел (Динд #2 по отношение на контейнера Infinito разполагане, който е Dind #1). Образът на бегача е построен от `roles/web-app-matrix/files/flavor/ansible/runner/Dockerfile` и закован през `services.matrix.runner.image`. Runner bound-mounts `/var/run/docker.sock`, `/etc/systemd/system`, `/run/systemd`, `/usr/local/bin`, `/matrix`, и MDAD проверка така MDAD пише земя в мястото на разполагане контейнер (Същият Docker демон и систематизиран като останалата част от стека)."

