msgid "The pipeline is invoked from [06_plugin.yml](../06_plugin.yml), which in turn runs once per iteration of the `NEXTCLOUD_PLUGIN_ITEMS` loop in [02_manager_ops.yml](../../02_manager_ops.yml). The loop variable `plugin_item` is unpacked into `plugin_key` (the OCC app name) and `plugin_value` (its meta entry)."
