# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys GitLab from the official Cloud Native GitLab (CNG) CE images at ``registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/`` as separate services: ``webservice`` (puma), ``sidekiq``, ``workhorse`` (sole HTTP entry point), ``gitaly``, ``shell`` (gitlab-sshd) and a one-shot ``migrations`` job. All images share a single version pin (``services.webservice.version``). PostgreSQL, Redis and S3-compatible object storage are wired through the platform lookups (central or sidecar), OIDC and SMTP through the platform SSO and email services. The front proxy terminates TLS and forwards HTTP to workhorse."
msgstr "Тази роля се разгръща GitLab от официалния Cloud Native GitLab (СПГ) CE изображения при ``registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/`` като отделни услуги: ``webservice`` (puma), ``sidekiq``, ``workhorse`` (единствен входен пункт HTTP), ``gitaly``, ``shell`` (gitlab- shd) и един изстрел ``migrations`` Работа. Всички изображения споделят една версия пин (``services.webservice.version``). PostgreSQL, Redis и S3-съвместимо съхранение на обект са свързани през платформата търси (централен или страничен вагон), OIDC и SMTP чрез платформата SSO и имейл услуги. Предният прокси прекратява TLS и препраща HTTP към работен кон."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys GitLab from the official Cloud Native GitLab (CNG) CE images at `registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/` as separate services: `webservice` (puma), `sidekiq`, `workhorse` (sole HTTP entry point), `gitaly`, `shell` (gitlab-sshd) and a one-shot `migrations` job. All images share a single version pin (`services.webservice.version`). PostgreSQL, Redis and S3-compatible object storage are wired through the platform lookups (central or sidecar), OIDC and SMTP through the platform SSO and email services. The front proxy terminates TLS and forwards HTTP to workhorse."
