# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Walk a (possibly nested) credentials schema and emit one vault block per scalar leaf into ``dest_node``. Nested dicts (e.g. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) recurse into nested CommentedMaps so each leaf becomes its own vault-encrypted entry instead of being collapsed via ``str(dict)`` into a Python-repr blob (the regression that broke run 26428080957 jobs 77797371397 and 77797371442 for web-app-espocrm and web-app-listmonk)."
msgstr "Върви. (вероятно гнездене) акредитивни схеми и излъчват един свод блок на скаларно листо в ``dest_node``. Гнездото на зарове (напр. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) recorcese into gunded CommentedMaps so every leaf becomes its own sell-recripted entry instead insteaded ``str(dict)`` в Python-repr blob (регресията, която се счупи 26428080957 Работа 77797371397 както и 77797371442 вместо web-app-espocrm както и web-app-listmonk)."

