msgstr "ЙОРС (Вашият собствен адрес Shortener) е решение за скъсяване на URL адреса, което ви позволява да създавате, проследявате и управлявате кратки връзки с лекота. Това разполагане помага на Docker да осигури сигурна и лесно мащабируема среда, гарантираща, че YOURLS примерът е конфигуриран за оптимална производителност и надеждност."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the ``shunt_is_valid_user`` drop-in in ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "YOURLS няма местно SSO; admin сесията е отсечена от Oauth2- proxy идентичност заглавна до ``shunt_is_valid_user`` вмъкване ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` persona остава жив и упражнения на моста край до края."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the `shunt_is_valid_user` drop-in in [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), so `biber` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, and the denial is asserted explicitly by `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. The `administrator` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "YOURLS няма местно SSO; admin сесията е отсечена от Oauth2- proxy идентичност заглавна до `shunt_is_valid_user` вмъкване [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), който почита заглавната част само на врата администратор път и само за членове на YOURLS администраторска група. Самата порта признава само същата RBAC група ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), така `biber` е отхвърлен преди YOURLS прави всичко: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) декларира `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, И отричането се твърди изрично от `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. `administrator` persona остава жив и упражнения на моста край до края."

