# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[006 - Service-gated Playwright tests](README.md#archive) established the `skipUnlessServiceEnabled(<service>)` contract: scenarios gate on `<SERVICE>_SERVICE_ENABLED` flags so a deploy with `disable=<service>` reports `skipped` instead of `failed`. [004 - Generic RBAC auto-provisioning](README.md#archive) plus [017 - Biber RBAC coverage](017-playwright-biber-rbac-coverage.md) extend that contract to RBAC-aware non-admin scenarios."
msgstr "[006 - Сервизни тестове Playwright](README.md#archive) е установено `skipUnlessServiceEnabled(<service>)` договор: сценарий портал на `<SERVICE>_SERVICE_ENABLED` знамена така разгърнат с `disable=<service>` доклади `skipped` вместо `failed`. [004 - Общо RBAC автоматично предоставяне](README.md#archive) Плюс [017 - Biber RBAC покритие](017-playwright-biber-rbac-coverage.md) да разшири този договор до RABA-aware не-admin сценарии."

