# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔑 **OIDC login via Keycloak (Option B, default on):** [`taiga-contrib-oidc-auth`](https://github.com/taigaio/taiga-contrib-oidc-auth) enables SSO via Keycloak → LDAP. **Note:** The OIDC plugin is not published on PyPI and requires a custom `taiga-front` image with the frontend plugin built in (CoffeeScript/Gulp). Without the custom frontend image the SSO button will not appear in the UI."
msgstr "🔑 **OIDC вход чрез Keycloak (Вариант Б, по подразбиране):** [`taiga-contrib-oidc-auth`](https://github.com/taigaio/taiga-contrib-oidc-auth) позволява SSO чрез Keycloak → LDAP. **Забележка:** Приставката OIDC не е публикувана на PyPI и изисква обичай `taiga-front` изображение с плъгин отпред вграден в (CoffeeScript/Gulp). Без потребителския преден образ бутонът SSO няма да се появи в UI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔑 **OIDC login via Keycloak (Option B, default on):** ```taiga-contrib-oidc-auth`` <https://github.com/taigaio/taiga-contrib-oidc-auth>`__ enables SSO via Keycloak → LDAP. **Note:** The OIDC plugin is not published on PyPI and requires a custom ``taiga-front`` image with the frontend plugin built in (CoffeeScript/Gulp). Without the custom frontend image the SSO button will not appear in the UI."
msgstr "🔑 **OIDC вход чрез Keycloak (Вариант Б, по подразбиране):** ```taiga-contrib-oidc-auth`` <https://github.com/taigaio/taiga-contrib-oidc-auth>`__ enables SSO via Keycloak → LDAP. **Note:** The OIDC plugin is not published on PyPI and requires a custom ``taiga-front`` изображение с плъгин отпред вграден в (CoffeeScript/Gulp). Без потребителския преден образ бутонът SSO няма да се появи в UI."

